WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.791 --> 00:00:32.208
If the soul itself is not the doer

2
00:00:32.208 --> 00:00:34.583
and material nature drives our actions

3
00:00:34.583 --> 00:00:37.916
according to our impressions...

4
00:00:37.916 --> 00:00:38.708
then are those

5
00:00:38.708 --> 00:00:41.750
who control this material nature,

6
00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:45.583
The Supreme Lord, 
responsible for all these actions?

7
00:00:45.583 --> 00:00:48.916
Does the responsibility 
for our sinful and virtuous deeds

8
00:00:48.916 --> 00:00:50.625
also fall upon Him?

9
00:00:50.625 --> 00:00:54.250
This question may arise
in anyone’s mind...

10
00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:56.166
Lord Krishna clarifies this question

11
00:00:56.166 --> 00:00:59.583
very clearly in this verse...

12
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:08.083
If the Supreme Lord is the ultimate controller,

13
00:01:08.083 --> 00:01:13.583
does this mean he is the driver
of beings' sinful or virtuous actions?

14
00:01:13.583 --> 00:01:15.791
Clarifying this question,

15
00:01:15.791 --> 00:01:18.583
Lord Krishna says in this verse,

16
00:01:18.583 --> 00:01:19.666
The Supreme Lord is neither

17
00:01:19.666 --> 00:01:21.958
responsible for any being's

18
00:01:21.958 --> 00:01:23.583
sinful actions

19
00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:26.916
nor takes credit for anyone's virtuous deeds...

20
00:01:26.916 --> 00:01:28.208
He does not interfere

21
00:01:28.208 --> 00:01:30.416
with beings' free will...

22
00:01:30.416 --> 00:01:32.375
Each being is responsible

23
00:01:32.375 --> 00:01:34.125
for their own actions

24
00:01:34.125 --> 00:01:36.125
and their results...

25
00:01:36.125 --> 00:01:39.541
The being, deluded by ignorance,

26
00:01:39.541 --> 00:01:42.166
thinks that he is the doer

27
00:01:42.166 --> 00:01:45.375
and experiences the results of his actions...

28
00:01:45.375 --> 00:01:46.333
This condition,

29
00:01:46.333 --> 00:01:47.250
which Lord Krishna calls

30
00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:50.375
'ignorance' or 'veil of ignorance,'

31
00:01:50.375 --> 00:01:53.125
covers the true nature of the soul...

32
00:01:53.125 --> 00:01:56.416
Due to this ignorance, the being

33
00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:58.791
mistakes its material body and senses

34
00:01:58.791 --> 00:02:00.125
as its real form

35
00:02:00.125 --> 00:02:03.500
and forgets its spiritual nature...

36
00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:06.875
and this very illusion becomes 
the cause of its actions...

37
00:02:06.875 --> 00:02:10.291
As long as the veil of 
ignorance remains in beings,

38
00:02:10.291 --> 00:02:13.583
the being will remain 
bound in the cycle of actions...

39
00:02:13.583 --> 00:02:17.833
and this very ignorance
keeps it bound in worldly attachments...

40
00:02:17.833 --> 00:02:20.250
But when this ignorance is removed

41
00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:21.750
and the soul recognizes

42
00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:23.500
its pure form...

43
00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:27.458
then the being realizes that it is neither the doer

44
00:02:27.458 --> 00:02:29.875
nor the enjoyer!

45
00:02:29.875 --> 00:02:32.083
If you too erase your ignorance

46
00:02:32.083 --> 00:02:33.458
with spiritual knowledge,

47
00:02:33.458 --> 00:02:34.250
you will be freed

48
00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:35.291
from the cycle of action

49
00:02:35.291 --> 00:02:38.291
and its sorrowful consequences...

50
00:02:38.291 --> 00:02:39.916
This is true knowledge,

51
00:02:39.916 --> 00:02:41.500
which introduces the soul

52
00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:43.875
to its real nature

53
00:02:43.875 --> 00:02:48.000
and liberates it from every bondage of life...

54
00:02:52.791 --> 00:02:58.208
When crisis or sorrow comes on life's path,

55
00:02:58.208 --> 00:03:00.708
this question must surely

56
00:03:00.708 --> 00:03:04.083
arise in your mind,

57
00:03:04.083 --> 00:03:06.791
"Why did this happen to me?

58
00:03:06.791 --> 00:03:09.125
Why did I receive this suffering?

59
00:03:09.125 --> 00:03:13.208
Why did God do this to me..?"

60
00:03:13.208 --> 00:03:15.583
But

61
00:03:15.583 --> 00:03:19.208
is it right to think so?

62
00:03:19.208 --> 00:03:21.458
The truth is that

63
00:03:21.458 --> 00:03:25.916
the pain or pleasure you are experiencing...

64
00:03:25.916 --> 00:03:30.708
is the result of your own actions..!

65
00:03:30.708 --> 00:03:32.416
Think,

66
00:03:32.416 --> 00:03:35.250
you have a garden...

67
00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:38.416
and you have sown seeds in it...

68
00:03:38.416 --> 00:03:41.833
If you sow a thorn seed,

69
00:03:41.833 --> 00:03:42.833
can you

70
00:03:42.833 --> 00:03:45.791
expect flowers?

71
00:03:45.791 --> 00:03:47.375
No...

72
00:03:47.375 --> 00:03:50.500
Because the seed you sow

73
00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:51.875
is what grows

74
00:03:51.875 --> 00:03:55.083
in your life.

75
00:03:55.083 --> 00:03:58.208
This is the situation with your actions.

76
00:03:58.208 --> 00:04:01.916
Ask yourself,

77
00:04:01.916 --> 00:04:05.291
did I (the Supreme Lord) order you

78
00:04:05.291 --> 00:04:07.875
to sow thorns?

79
00:04:07.875 --> 00:04:09.250
No..!

80
00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:12.375
You make this decision yourself...

81
00:04:12.375 --> 00:04:13.916
I am only

82
00:04:13.916 --> 00:04:16.791
a guide...

83
00:04:16.791 --> 00:04:20.666
It is your freedom to choose

84
00:04:20.666 --> 00:04:22.541
which seed to sow.

85
00:04:22.541 --> 00:04:24.708
If you sow seeds

86
00:04:24.708 --> 00:04:29.083
like jealousy, anger and greed,

87
00:04:29.083 --> 00:04:32.416
then those very thorns will grow in your life

88
00:04:32.416 --> 00:04:37.625
which will give you sorrow, hardship and pain...!

89
00:04:37.625 --> 00:04:44.708
But if you sow seeds of love, 
compassion and surrender,

90
00:04:44.708 --> 00:04:48.250
then those very flowers will bloom in your life,

91
00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:51.541
which will provide you peace, contentment

92
00:04:51.541 --> 00:04:54.416
and happiness!

93
00:04:54.416 --> 00:04:57.625
Therefore, much more important

94
00:04:57.625 --> 00:05:00.458
than blaming the Supreme Lord

95
00:05:00.458 --> 00:05:03.708
in life's hardships

96
00:05:03.708 --> 00:05:07.583
is that you reflect on your actions.

97
00:05:07.583 --> 00:05:10.375
When you understand

98
00:05:10.375 --> 00:05:12.750
that your actions

99
00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:16.833
determine your life's fruits,

100
00:05:16.833 --> 00:05:20.625
then you can completely change

101
00:05:20.625 --> 00:05:24.250
the path of your life.

102
00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:27.166
This is true knowledge,

103
00:05:27.166 --> 00:05:30.166
this is true happiness!

104
00:05:34.791 --> 00:05:36.875
Imagine that,

105
00:05:36.875 --> 00:05:39.833
In life's ocean

106
00:05:39.833 --> 00:05:41.875
a storm has suddenly come,

107
00:05:41.875 --> 00:05:44.083
Waves of financial crisis,

108
00:05:44.083 --> 00:05:46.708
storms of bitterness in relationships,

109
00:05:46.708 --> 00:05:49.333
or doors of opportunity

110
00:05:49.333 --> 00:05:53.083
suddenly closed.

111
00:05:53.083 --> 00:05:55.208
In such difficult circumstances,

112
00:05:55.208 --> 00:05:59.750
how does your mind react?

113
00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:05.541
Do you think, "Why did they do this to me..." or

114
00:06:05.541 --> 00:06:08.208
“Why did god let this happen?”

115
00:06:08.208 --> 00:06:10.833
But, remember,

116
00:06:10.833 --> 00:06:14.833
family is like a temple

117
00:06:14.833 --> 00:06:17.583
and your speech and behavior

118
00:06:17.583 --> 00:06:23.291
are that divine light which 
illuminates this temple.

119
00:06:23.291 --> 00:06:27.125
In difficult times, your balanced thinking

120
00:06:27.125 --> 00:06:29.291
and sweet words are the flowers

121
00:06:29.291 --> 00:06:32.583
that circulate peace

122
00:06:32.583 --> 00:06:35.291
and love in the family.

123
00:06:35.291 --> 00:06:37.916
When adverse circumstances come

124
00:06:37.916 --> 00:06:39.666
and plans fail,

125
00:06:39.666 --> 00:06:44.291
it seems very simple to blame.

126
00:06:44.291 --> 00:06:46.208
But in such times,

127
00:06:46.208 --> 00:06:49.791
you should speak the language of patience,

128
00:06:49.791 --> 00:06:52.750
wisdom and love,

129
00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:56.583
which not only gives peace to your mind,

130
00:06:56.583 --> 00:07:00.666
but also enriches the family...

131
00:07:00.666 --> 00:07:03.875
Let's understand this with an example.

132
00:07:03.875 --> 00:07:05.166
Suppose,

133
00:07:05.166 --> 00:07:06.708
a tree's fruit

134
00:07:06.708 --> 00:07:08.583
became sour,

135
00:07:08.583 --> 00:07:12.958
does the gardener cut down that tree?

136
00:07:12.958 --> 00:07:14.458
No!

137
00:07:14.458 --> 00:07:17.500
He pours water and manure in its roots,

138
00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:19.500
so that sweet fruits

139
00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:20.666
are obtained next time.

140
00:07:20.666 --> 00:07:22.541
Similarly,

141
00:07:22.541 --> 00:07:26.666
when any dispute or crisis arises in the family,

142
00:07:26.666 --> 00:07:28.625
one should step towards solution

143
00:07:28.625 --> 00:07:35.375
not with anger and bitterness, 
but with love and wisdom

144
00:07:35.375 --> 00:07:37.250
This nature of yours

145
00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:39.250
becomes a bright inspiration

146
00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:42.083
for coming generations.

147
00:07:42.083 --> 00:07:49.958
As rivers cut their path through 
hard mountain stones with their flow,

148
00:07:49.958 --> 00:07:54.458
similarly, with love and patience,

149
00:07:54.458 --> 00:07:57.416
solution to every problem is possible...

150
00:07:57.416 --> 00:07:59.166
Remember,

151
00:07:59.166 --> 00:08:01.708
when you choose the path of love,

152
00:08:01.708 --> 00:08:04.750
empathy and wisdom

153
00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:08.750
instead of anger, blame and despair,

154
00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:10.833
a new energy

155
00:08:10.833 --> 00:08:13.875
circulates in the family.

156
00:08:13.875 --> 00:08:16.291
This is the path

157
00:08:16.291 --> 00:08:19.208
of happiness and peace!

158
00:08:23.666 --> 00:08:25.708
I know that

159
00:08:25.708 --> 00:08:27.541
professional life

160
00:08:27.541 --> 00:08:30.208
is like a battlefield.

161
00:08:30.208 --> 00:08:32.125
Here each day

162
00:08:32.125 --> 00:08:34.958
is like a new test.

163
00:08:34.958 --> 00:08:37.625
Sometimes you succeed,

164
00:08:37.625 --> 00:08:40.583
sometimes you fail.

165
00:08:40.583 --> 00:08:45.125
But do you face those failures

166
00:08:45.125 --> 00:08:47.375
in the right way?

167
00:08:47.375 --> 00:08:48.833
Imagine,

168
00:08:48.833 --> 00:08:50.916
your organization

169
00:08:50.916 --> 00:08:53.708
has worked tirelessly to complete

170
00:08:53.708 --> 00:08:55.833
an important task.

171
00:08:55.833 --> 00:09:00.708
Made every proper effort to make it successful,

172
00:09:00.708 --> 00:09:02.750
but the result

173
00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:07.083
did not come according to your expectations.

174
00:09:07.083 --> 00:09:09.541
Naturally, there can be turmoil

175
00:09:09.541 --> 00:09:12.583
in your mind in this situation

176
00:09:12.583 --> 00:09:15.666
and thoughts may come,

177
00:09:15.666 --> 00:09:17.583
"If my organization

178
00:09:17.583 --> 00:09:20.750
had worked harder,"

179
00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:23.666
or "If circumstances had been favorable,

180
00:09:23.666 --> 00:09:26.500
we would have succeeded."

181
00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:29.375
But wait!

182
00:09:29.375 --> 00:09:32.083
This cycle of blame

183
00:09:32.083 --> 00:09:34.291
will neither give any solution

184
00:09:34.291 --> 00:09:38.458
nor make you better.

185
00:09:38.458 --> 00:09:42.250
In business, it is necessary 
not only to blame others,

186
00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:45.333
but to evaluate yourself

187
00:09:45.333 --> 00:09:47.166
and learn

188
00:09:47.166 --> 00:09:50.291
from your failures.

189
00:09:50.291 --> 00:09:54.791
As a potter shapes clay again and again,

190
00:09:54.791 --> 00:09:57.791
self-reflection

191
00:09:57.791 --> 00:10:02.875
can turn your failure into success.

192
00:10:02.875 --> 00:10:08.875
Circumstances and failures 
polish your character.

193
00:10:08.875 --> 00:10:10.750
"Those who learn from these,

194
00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:15.208
proceed on their journey to victory."

195
00:10:15.208 --> 00:10:18.041
When you face failure 

196
00:10:18.041 --> 00:10:21.291
without blaming anyone,

197
00:10:21.291 --> 00:10:25.166
then you become not only a better person, 

198
00:10:25.166 --> 00:10:28.583
but also an inspiring leader.

199
00:10:28.583 --> 00:10:32.166
and if you fail sometime in future, 

200
00:10:32.166 --> 00:10:34.541
remember,

201
00:10:34.541 --> 00:10:36.625
This is not a halt,

202
00:10:36.625 --> 00:10:39.083
this is a learning stage!"
